step "Using Tab/Shift-Tab outside the editor and Ctrl-Tab/Ctrl-Shift-Tab anywhere, verify focus reaches editor, Run, and theme switch."
step "Edit/select SQL with the keyboard and activate Run and the theme switch with Space/Enter as appropriate."
step "Editor Tab intentionally indents; Ctrl-Tab must leave it. Cmd-Enter on macOS (Ctrl-Enter elsewhere) must Run without inserting a newline."
verified_observation KEYBOARD_ACCESS "Keyboard alone reached/operated editor, Run, and theme switch with visible focus and no focus trap"
