verified_observation THEMES_RETAINED "Both themes were readable and preserved the successful SQL text, results, path, and status"
say "Busy check: read these instructions BEFORE running the slow query (about a five-second deadline)."
step "While Running query… is visible, verify Run/Open Demo Database cannot submit duplicate work."
step "During that same busy interval, toggle theme and replace editor text with the recovery SQL below."
step "Verify theme stays responsive, SQL edits remain, path stays fixed, and no stale results are shown."
say "Recovery text to enter while busy (do not run until timeout):"
say "SELECT id, body FROM notes WHERE body = 'Persistence verified';"
ui_sql 'WITH RECURSIVE slow(n) AS (SELECT 1 UNION ALL SELECT n + 1 FROM slow WHERE n < 1000000000000) SELECT sum(n) FROM slow;'
note "If too quick to observe all checks, repeat the slow read; never claim an unobserved busy state."
verified_observation BUSY_UI "Observed Running query, inert Run/Open, responsive theme, retained editor edits/path, and no stale results while busy"
