stage "Close again and record the final acceptance report"
step "Click the red native window-close button again; verify the restarted window disappears."
verified_observation FINAL_WINDOW_CLOSED "Closed the restarted native window normally with its red close button"
wait_native_exit 2
cli_expect "final on-disk contents after second native exit" 'SELECT id, body FROM notes ORDER BY id;' \
